[Quake-RTS - README]

[Introduction]

This mod turns quake 4 into a generic rts game.

To Install:
1) place the quake-rts folder in the base of your quake 4 installation
2) run Quake-rts.bat to launch the "quake-rts" mod in quake 4

[How to Play]

Objective: destroy your opponent's buildings without losing your own.

This mod changes the player's view to a top-down perspective. using a laser pointer, 
they can direct their troops to move towards objectives.

Troops will automatically engage enemy forces in range.

players can epand how many and what kind of units they can build by building
more base structures. additionally, placing turrets can be useful for defending
your base.
